module gunbc.seed_growth


data seed_growth_note: String = "Temporary hand-authored Rust debt, stated as an obligation roster rather than a size. A SeedGrowthJustification says which declarations a change adds to the seed, why the substrate cannot yet carry them, which roadmap lane owns their dissolution, what triggers it, and what the current boundary is.\n\nWHY THIS IS ITS OWN AUTHORITY AND NOT PART OF THE ROADMAP. The carrier states a fact about a few Rust declarations; it does not need the roadmap graph, its node table, its edges, or its acceptance receipts. Homing the type in gunbc.roadmap_authority forced every low-level module that wanted to declare seed debt to import the entire roadmap to do it -- gunbc.stage0_rust_host_observation, a host-observation carrier, depended on the roadmap authority for this one type alone. That is the dependency pointing the wrong way: the roadmap consumes seed-debt facts, so the roadmap imports this module, not the reverse. RoadmapNodeId stays as the owning-lane reference because naming the lane IS the point of the row, and it comes from gunbc.roadmap_model, which is the identity vocabulary rather than the graph.\n\nWHAT THE ROSTER DOES NOT GUARANTEE, STATED SO IT IS NOT MISREAD AS CLOSED. hand_authored_declarations is an AUTHORED OBLIGATION ROSTER, not a derived denominator. It is strictly better than a line-count literal -- each row names a declaration that either resolves or does not -- but nothing structurally prevents a later helper added to the same Rust file from escaping it, because the roster is written by hand rather than derived from the source population. Closing that gap needs a census that compares every newly authored Rust declaration in a change against these rows and refuses on the difference; until such a join exists the honest rung is mechanically preventive for the declarations listed, and silent for the ones nobody listed. That completeness join belongs to the honest-frontier lane, not here."

type SeedGrowthJustification {
  hand_authored_declarations: List<DeclarationRef>
  reason: String
  owning_dissolution_lane: RoadmapNodeId
  trigger: String
  current_boundary: String
}
